{
  "name": "dsh-harness-flow",
  "description": "驾驭工程模式流程面板（可选组件）：会话顶栏入口，显示项目总目标 / 当前对话目标 / 可自选线路的循环流程图；模型经 harness_flow 工具同步阶段推进，用户点节点/回路切换线路。仅 harness（驾驭工程模式）preset 会话显示面板。纯提示词运行不需要本插件；面板不拦截任何工具调用。",
  "version": "0.15.2",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "README.md",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "engines": {
      "dsh": ">=0.1.5-rc.1 || >=0.2.0-rc"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
}
